    "detailed_description": "The world's been flooded! Why, you ask? No one knows! But perhaps you\u2019ll find clues during your perilous (FUN!) journey to the (MYTHICAL?) <strong>Final Island</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/177dc921c45ed9c2c63a6af66940f1e5.poster.avif?t=1727297331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/177dc921c45ed9c2c63a6af66940f1e5.webm?t=1727297331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Team up with up to 3 friends in <strong>online or local co-op</strong>  or play solo to tackle ever-changing roguelike runs through a wide variety of thrilling biomes. Select trinkets wisely to construct the overpowered build that will finally lead you and your crew to paradise!  (Or\u2026 to DOOM!  Most likely doom, let\u2019s be honest.)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/9277c3cac8b3c053b86926035c52444d.poster.avif?t=1727297331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/9277c3cac8b3c053b86926035c52444d.webm?t=1727297331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play with up to 3 friends in <strong>online/local multiplayer</strong>, or <strong>go solo</strong> if you dare!<br></li><li>A unique blend of <strong>shooter and builder</strong> \u2013 expand your raft while defending it from the creatures of the sea who (rudely!) seek to destroy it!<br></li><li>Gather wealth from your fallen foes and use it to <strong>buy upgrades</strong> to strengthen your crew!<br></li><li>Unlock new <strong>weapons and cosmetics</strong> for your favorite characters as you play!<br></li><li>Looking for a real challenge? Give <strong>looping </strong>a shot! (And try not to develop a permanent marine life phobia while you\u2019re at it!)<br></li><li>Super Raft Boat Together is the <strong>multiplayer sequel</strong> to the beloved <i>Super Raft Boat Classic</i> by Shattered Journal Games!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/6e6dfa4636d4adc1c13c7903aa132fe1.poster.avif?t=1727297331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/6e6dfa4636d4adc1c13c7903aa132fe1.webm?t=1727297331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
