rite characters as you play!<br></li><li>Looking for a real challenge? Give <strong>looping </strong>a shot! (And try not to develop a permanent marine life phobia while you\u2019re at it!)<br></li><li>Super Raft Boat Together is the <strong>multiplayer sequel</strong> to the beloved <i>Super Raft Boat Classic</i> by Shattered Journal Games!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/6e6dfa4636d4adc1c13c7903aa132fe1.poster.avif?t=1727297331\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955340/extras/6e6dfa4636d4adc1c13c7903aa132fe1.webm?t=1727297331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
